    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description: &quot;Infinite Mining: The Stone Saga \u2013 Expansion: Curious Mushrooms and Stones of Light&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 <strong>&quot;Mine it! Upgrade it! Mine it more!&quot;</strong> \u26cf\ufe0f<br>Now, the joy of mining rocks is just the beginning. Enjoy a rich <strong>pro-miner lifestyle</strong> with endless features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c The Ultimate Miner Skill Tree:</strong><br>Build up your <strong>proficiency</strong>! Every strike you make fills your proficiency bar.<br>Use it to enhance your mining speed and power, tearing through the mines at <strong>lightning speed</strong>! \ud83c\udf00 (Who even remembers mining manually these days?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2697\ufe0f Alchemy:</strong><br>Is just mining rocks starting to feel boring? Become the <strong>alchemist of the mines</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform common rocks into rare, valuable ones with \u2728<strong>the magic of mining alchemy</strong>\u2728</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even useless pebbles? Combine them to create decorative items and impress your friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf44 Mushroom Library!</strong> <br>&quot;Why are mushrooms in a mine?&quot; Don\u2019t question it\u2014this is a <strong>fantasy mine</strong>.<br>Collect mushrooms to complete the Library, and what happens next?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Unlock brand-new abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb4 Feel oddly healthier and stroger!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Reborn(rebirth) System: The Secret : Stone of Light</strong> <br>Want to grow endlessly stronger? The <strong>Reborn System</strong> is the answer!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset all most things, but keep the <strong>Stones of Light</strong> and<strong>\u00a0</strong>else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them for <strong>powerful upgrades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow faster and stronger, reaching the peak of the mines once more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A miner who hasn\u2019t reborn isn\u2019t a true miner&quot;</i> \u2013 and yes, we mean it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Infinite Content, Infinite Mining!</strong><br>Mine rocks to grow stronger, grow stronger to delve deeper, and when you\u2019re ready\u2026 reborn and repeat! Are you ready to become the god of mining?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>&quot;Mine: FOREVER&quot;</strong>, start now! <br>\ud83c\udf1f Today, you\u2019re just a miner, but tomorrow, you\u2019ll be a shining legend.</p>",
