eep the <strong>Stones of Light</strong> and<strong>\u00a0</strong>else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them for <strong>powerful upgrades</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow faster and stronger, reaching the peak of the mines once more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A miner who hasn\u2019t reborn isn\u2019t a true miner&quot;</i> \u2013 and yes, we mean it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Infinite Content, Infinite Mining!</strong><br>Mine rocks to grow stronger, grow stronger to delve deeper, and when you\u2019re ready\u2026 reborn and repeat! Are you ready to become the god of mining?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>&quot;Mine: FOREVER&quot;</strong>, start now! <br>\ud83c\udf1f Today, you\u2019re just a miner, but tomorrow, you\u2019ll be a shining legend.</p>",
